Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 Permission Profile Revalidation P0 Data Design

@ [design_uuid] d0691fa1-6945-4ac2-a6cd-d1446d43ae6d
@ [source_snapshot_uuid] 3654826b-14d1-4e96-81a4-ab27be83dcd8

& [Forms]
  + CapabilityEvidenceManifest closes profile source snapshot predecessor and exactly one observation identity
  + CapabilityObservation closes executable schema profile command transcript sentinel and effect-boundary facts
  + AppServerFrame is strict JSON with request id or notification method and exact result bodies required by the ordered probe
  + CapabilityReceipt closes host capability writer NotRun authority counts caveats observation digests and one domain-separated self-digest

& [Invariants]
  + every evidence path is one exact direct child beneath a canonical caller-supplied root and every byte is bounded and rehashed before parse
  + strict JSON rejects duplicate and unknown keys nonfinite numbers oversized strings and trailing values
  + executable version path byte length and SHA256 remain exactly pinned to the previously operator-selected host
  + stable schema facts remain readOnly type plus networkAccess while experimental facts require permissionProfile and filesystem read write deny support
  + transcript order is initialize result optional known local status notification profile list allowed command denied command
  + allowed command must return only the allowed sentinel and denied command must return empty stdout plus Access is denied
  + capability receipt keeps writer_run_count model_turn_count provider_contact_count mcp_call_count Git mutation cleanup and D-drive contact zero
  + record digest is domain-separated SHA256 over the exact receipt with an all-zero digest placeholder

& [DualHemisphere]
  + semantic hemisphere owns historical NotRun preservation capability supersession meaning beta caveats and nonauthority
  + physical hemisphere owns executable and schema identities transcript bytes sentinel results and digest recomputation
  + convergence is one deterministic host_capability_verified_writer_not_run receipt
